{"id": "EUVD-2026-97605", "enisaUuid": "f08b229b-13d9-3f53-bd6a-aa50c2d8baf0", "description": "Parse Server before 8.6.93 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.1-alpha.13 does not enforce identity-scoped protectedFields (authenticated, role, or per-user groups) on count queries using the $relatedTo operator, exposing the size of protected Relation fields. An authenticated user who can read the owning object can combine counts with an objectId constraint as a membership oracle to reveal confidential memberships such as private groups or block lists.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:05:00", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:00:25", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/parse-community/parse-server/security/advisories/GHSA-rmhf-xv62-rm99", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/parse-server-before-8.6.93-and-9.0.0-before-9.10.1-alpha.13-protectedfields-bypass-via-relation-count-query"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109303", "GHSA-pq6r-p5vh-4c89"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5729f060-d497-3b10-8870-289c0a68b07b", "product": {"name": "parse-server", "vendor": {"name": "parse-community"}}, "product_version": "9.0.0 <9.10.1-alpha.13"}, {"id": "9f3649c8-aa21-3ae9-a150-bba6ae7b2996", "product": {"name": "parse-server", "vendor": {"name": "parse-community"}}, "product_version": "0 <8.6.93"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "67a8a9dc-4adf-3ec1-8333-2e8766d3dd66", "vendor": {"name": "parse-community"}}], "isExploited": false}